1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,920
and let it relax.

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:04,960
All right, we're gonna go ahead and get ready

3
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,260
for our HIIT workout.

4
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:07,720
We're gonna be doing four exercises

5
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:08,760
straight through in a group,

6
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,620
each one we're doing for 60 seconds,

7
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:13,400
then 50, then 40, then 30, then 20, then 10.

8
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,560
You get a 10 second rest

9
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,400
in between each one of those groups.

10
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,760
Let's go ahead and start with our first one,

11
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:18,600
the flutter kicks.

12
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,960
One minute straight through.

13
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,360
And start them up.

14
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:24,080
So you're gonna start out with that flutter kick motion

15
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:26,280
with those feet, kicking those feet front to back,

16
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:28,000
then you're gonna pause with them in the center,

17
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,920
squat down really nice and low,

18
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:31,560
and then start that flutter kick motion again

19
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,160
with that opposite foot forward.

20
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,420
So it's gonna be two kicks,

21
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:36,000
and then squat down in the middle,

22
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,120
then two kicks again, squat in the middle again.

23
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,280
Just keep it going,

24
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,760
trying to get as deep of a squat

25
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:41,840
every single time as you can,

26
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,160
and trying to move those feet

27
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:45,760
in that flutter kick motion as quickly as you can.

28
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,200
Now we're just about halfway done.

29
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,440
We've got just over 30 seconds left.

30
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:52,120
So keep that motion going as solid as you can.

31
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,220
Really try to push it.

32
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:55,620
You wanna be nice and tired by the time you're done.

